        "translation": {
          "textId": "translation:group:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices",
          "legacyField": "fullTranslationZh",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:1"
              ],
              "start": 0,
              "end": 82,
              "quote": "随着油价上涨，机场安检队伍排得比以往更长，何不把下一次国内度假安排成火车旅行呢？与其他出行方式相比，坐火车舒适又轻松。下面是一些建议，帮助你尽可能愉快地乘火车出游。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2"
              ],
              "start": 84,
              "end": 148,
              "quote": "提前计划。大多数长途列车，尤其是卧铺，很快就会售罄。在繁忙的夏季月份，情况尤其如此。不过，无论何时出行，最好至少提前90天预订。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3"
              ],
              "start": 150,
              "end": 262,
              "quote": "找旅行代理人。可以考虑把旅行计划交给旅行代理人，让他再次核对所有细节、提出建议，然后办理实际预订。好的代理人有时能帮你找到打折车票。他还可能帮你订到紧挨餐车的卧铺。这样，你就不必为了每天三顿饭，在行驶的火车上穿过好几节车厢。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4"
              ],
              "start": 264,
              "end": 325,
              "quote": "带一条毯子。乘坐火车时，即使是过夜行程，也不会免费提供毯子。车厢里的温度往往很难控制。尤其在夏天，空调会让车厢变得相当冷。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5"
              ],
              "start": 327,
              "end": 412,
              "quote": "早点到。大多数列车每天只开一班，有的每周只开三班，所以错过自己的那班车可能是件糟糕的事。你可能要等超过24小时才能赶上下一班。注意：时刻表上列的是发车时间，不是到站时间。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "translation:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6"
              ],
              "start": 414,
              "end": 545,
              "quote": "玩得开心。火车旅行不适合没耐心的人。读本书、织织毛衣、做做填字游戏，或者只是看看窗外不断展开的景色。看风景时若想计算速度，就用3600（一小时的秒数）除以行驶一英里（两根里程标之间的距离）所花的秒数。如果火车行驶一英里用了53秒，那么你的时速就是67.92英里。"
            }
          ]
        },
        "completedSourceTexts": [
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:2",
            "text": "Plan ahead. Most long-distance trains, especially the sleeping car accommodations, sell out very quickly. That's particularly true during busy summer months. But no matter when you travel, it's a good idea to make your reservations at least 90 days in advance."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3",
            "text": "Use a travel agent. Consider turning your travel plan over to a travel agent and letting him double-check all the details, make suggestions, and then handle the actual reservations. A good one can sometimes find you discounted tickets. He may also book you in a sleeping car that's right next to the diner. Then you won’t have to walk through several cars on a moving train three times a day for your meals."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4",
            "text": "Bring a blanket. When you’re riding on trains, you won't be provided with a blanket for free, even if your trip is an overnight one. The temperature on rail cars is often hard to control. In the summer in particular, the air conditioning can make them quite cold."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5",
            "text": "Arrive early. Most trains operate just once a day and some run only three times a week, so missing yours can be a disaster. You might have to wait longer than 24 hours to catch the next one. Note: The times listed on the schedules are departure times, not arrival times."
          },
          {
            "textId": "completed:block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
            "paragraphId": "block:paper-gaokao-2023-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6",
            "text": "Have fun. Train trips aren't for impatient types. Read a book, knit, do a crossword puzzle, or simply watch the world unfold outside the window. To calculate your speed as you do, divide 3,600 (the number of seconds in an hour) by the number of seconds it takes you to travel one mile (the distance between two mileposts). If it takes the train 53 seconds to travel one mile, you’re going 67.92 mph."
          }
        ],
